## How to revise

Fix the compilation error. Read the error for the exact construct or call
that failed to translate, and prefer expressing the same logic with a
simpler, more directly-translatable construct over adding complexity around
it. If the loop's overall structure is the source of the problem rather than
one call site, rewrite the method body instead of making only local edits.
Return exactly the corrected method body: rationale block, proof sketch block, then body statements.
Begin your output with `// CSD_RATIONALE_BEGIN` — no prose, no preamble, no Markdown fence above it.
